	(descr "Bourns SC series breaker (surface-mount thermal cutoff, a bimetal with a self-hold PTC), e.g. SC72AAB: opens at 72 +-5 C, resets once 10 C below its minimum trip and unpowered. Body 4.4-4.7 x 2.8 mm, 0.94 mm (SCxxAAB) / 1.07 mm (SCxxAAA) tall; four bottom terminals: pads 1 = arm terminals, pads 2 = base terminals. Land pattern per the Bourns SC datasheet: 0.7 x 0.7 mm pads on 3.42 x 2.3 mm centres. Reflow (up to 3 passes, <= 260 C) or hand soldering; not flow soldering. (lid_2, 2026-10-08)")
